{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the role of a lone warrior as she scours mysterious, hostile ruins in search of the one she must slay: the Guardian of the Ruins. Take on powerful enemies. Learn and master combat mechanics such as dodging, parrying and different types of attack. Explore and collect various weapons and shields in labyrinthine ruins, lost in the middle of the sky. Survive, and find the final arena where your final enemy lies: an absolutely fearsome Boss.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726500?t=1750925740","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726500?t=1750925740","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726500/19222d9407b76455588b2829d0bc4d4d190c773b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750925740","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726500/19222d9407b76455588b2829d0bc4d4d190c773b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750925740","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the role of a lone warrior as she scours mysterious, hostile ruins in search of the one she must slay: the Guardian of the Ruins. Take on powerful enemies. Learn and master combat mechanics such as dodging, parrying and different types of attack. Explore and collect various weapons and shields in labyrinthine ruins, lost in the middle of the sky. Survive, and find the final arena where your final enemy lies: an absolutely fearsome Boss.</p>","developers":["Marcus Basquaise"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726500/994124277ea9490a00dbe2ed9ab19bf5687b5b6f/header.jpg?t=1750925740","is_fr